{"Settings", "Display", "Larger Sprite Pool", "The DS has room for 33 unit sprite sheets. With three armies, creatures or custom units a match can need more, and the game then drew the units that did not fit with another unit's sprites. On, every sheet gets a slot of its own, and 3D uni"},
