{"Settings", "Display", "Use Mod and Editor Maps", "Maps from the mods folder (.nds files, map folders, your Level Editor maps) join Free Play and the lobby, two-player ones too. Off: the game's own maps only; maps a host sends you still load. Read when the game starts or the maps are loaded"},
