{"Settings", "Music", "Hear Only Your Own Upgrades", "The game plays the \"upgrade complete\" chime for every army's upgrades, the computers' included, wherever they are on the map. On, you hear it only for your own. Off, as on the DS. Only you hear this; it is not sent to other players."},
