{"Balance", "Spells", "Hotwire Neutral Units In Missions", "Single-player missions only. Hotwire can also take units and buildings of a team the computer is not playing. Off: as in the game. Has no effect with Anything, online or in Free Play."},
{"Balance", "Spells", "Hotwired Transports Leave Their Old Owner", "Normally a transport stolen from the computer keeps following its old owner's orders for a while. On, it stops at once."},
{"Balance", "Spells", "EMP Disables Transports", "EMP normally hits special units only. On, it hits transports too. Online, the host's setting applies."},
{"Balance", "Spells", "More Than 10 Mine Spots", "A map can have up to 32 mine, quarry or well cap spots. Off: the game's own limit of 10; spots past the tenth are not usable. Stock maps have 10 or fewer, so they play the same either way. Online, the host's setting applies."},
{"Balance", "Spells", "Stunned Heroes Can Cast", "ESP and EMP normally stop a hero casting. On, a stunned hero can still cast. Online, the host's setting applies."},
{"Balance", "Spells", "Soldiers Repair Buildings", "Foot, ranged and mounted units can repair your damaged buildings and help build new ones, as builders do. Select them and tap the building: the game gives the order to the whole selection. Off: only heroes, builders and units whose Repairs "},
{"Balance", "Spells", "Smarter Unit Movement", "A move order for several units gives each one its own spot in a block round the place you tapped, so they spread out instead of all heading for the same tile and crowding round it. Off: every unit is sent to the tapped tile, as in the game."},
{"Balance", "Spells", "Fix Hotwired Healing", "Heal normally skips hotwired units. On, it heals them too. Online, the host's setting applies."},
{"Balance", "Spells", "AI Uses Targeted Spells", "Computer heroes also cast spells aimed at a unit (damage, boosts, Hotwire, EMP), not just area and self spells. Hotwire is cast on an enemy siege or special unit near a computer hero. Recordings keep it. Not online."},
