{"Network", "Multiplayer", "Lobby Shows the Current Map", "The game's lobby can keep showing the previous match's map until the host picks again. On: the label follows the lobby's map. Looks only."},
{"Network", "Multiplayer", "Show the Lobby's Server", "While hosting or joined, a line in the lobby names the server it is on."},
{"Network", "Multiplayer", "Prevent Phantom Ties", "A phantom tie is the two games of a match drifting apart. One cause is measured: spell stun length and range follow each machine's own cheats, so two players with different cheats see different fights. On (default): everyone plays the host'"},
{"Network", "Multiplayer", "Master server", "Where lobbies are listed. It also connects players, so most routers need no port forwarding. king.legobattles.win is run by another player and may be offline. Both uses both servers."},
{"Network", "Multiplayer", "Ping servers", "Lower is better. No answer means the server may be offline."},
