{"Maps", "Patches", "Export", ""},
{"Maps", "Patches", "For this port", "The cartridge the game is running now, exactly: every enabled mod map and custom unit. Players of this port import it below. The added maps and units need this port's code: on a DS or another emulator the game does not list them."},
{"Maps", "Patches", "For a DS or another emulator", "Mod maps put in place of the game's own Free Play maps (one slot each), with their names, as the community's map patches do. Plays on real hardware and in any emulator. Custom units can't go in: they need this port's code."},
{"Maps", "Patches", "Export xdelta patch...", "Writes an .xdelta file that turns the European LEGO Battles ROM into the ROM above. Making it takes a few seconds; the game keeps running."},
{"Maps", "Patches", "Import", ""},
{"Maps", "Patches", "Import xdelta patch...", "Applies a patch made for the European ROM (from this page, or a community map patch) to your ROM in memory and installs what it changed as mods: its maps in mods/maps/Imported, its custom units (and re-skinned units) in mods/units. Your ROM"},
{"Maps", "Patches", "Apply it to another ROM...", "For a patch made for another release (the community's ROM hacks are built on the USA one): choose that ROM, your own dump of it. The patch is applied to it in memory and its maps and units are installed the same way. That ROM file is only r"},
{"Maps", "Patches", "Save the patched ROM...", "Writes the last imported patch's whole ROM, for another emulator, the mods folder (its Free Play maps are read from there too) or Balance > Presets' import from a ROM."},
{"Maps", "Patches", "Load new maps and units now", "Resets to the title screen with the imported maps and units in the game. Ends any match in progress."},
