{"Tools", "Recordings", "Record every session", "Records each session to a new lb-session-*.lbdemo beside the game, so bugs can be replayed. From the next start. Off by default."},
{"Tools", "Recordings", "File", "Saved as you play, so closing the window loses nothing. LB_DEMO_REC / LB_DEMO_PLAY do the same from the command line."},
