{"Tools", "Windows", "Top Screen in its own window", "Moves the Top Screen panel out of the game window into a window of its own, so you can drag it to another monitor or beside the game and keep the battlefield clear. Clicks work as on the panel (cancel queue, unload, minimap). Resize it free"},
{"Tools", "Windows", "Show the whole battlefield (panel)", "Shows the whole level in a panel. The white box is what the game window shows."},
